  SWEET RESET: early restart reason 0x77665500 (fastboot)
  SWEET RESET: early hook install, safety WDT 120 s
  SWEET WDT: armed bite in 3932160 ticks
  SWEET WDT: bite (STS=0x...)
  SWEET RESET: arm_init hook -
  ... normal boot ...
  SWEET HALT: PE_halt_restart already hooked early
  SWEET WDT: safety WDT disarmed (STS=0x...)
  SWEET RESET: restart reason cleared (normal boot)
and a panic before onc_emmc_init now resets into fastboot (reason 0x77665500
is still set), while a panic after it resets normally (reason cleared).
